doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21518698"
url: "https://stefanosbalaskas.github.io/gp3bayes/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  gp3bayes provides transparent, contract-first infrastructure for Bayesian
  analysis of repeated-measures and hierarchical behavioural data. It supports
  approved Bernoulli-logit and positive lognormal duration workflows with
  strict readiness auditing, deterministic simulation, recorded
  transformations, inspectable priors, prior and posterior predictive checks,
  restricted optional full-MCMC fitting through brms with either rstan or
  cmdstanr, sampling diagnostics, explicit posterior estimands, sensitivity
  analysis, predictive validation, simulation-based calibration, and
  conservative reporting.
keywords:
  - Bayesian workflows
  - hierarchical models
  - repeated measures
  - behavioural data
  - posterior predictive checks
  - sensitivity analysis
  - predictive validation
